# Licensing

This project contains two types of content with different licenses:

## Code (flake.nix, tests/, treefmt.nix)

Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0)

You are free to:
- Share — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- Adapt — remix, transform, and build upon the material

Under the following terms:
- Attribution — You must give appropriate credit
- NonCommercial — You may not use the material for commercial purposes
- ShareAlike — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same license

Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/legalcode

## Data (data/)

The license data is derived from upstream sources under their respective licenses:
- ScanCode LicenseDB: CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
- choosealicense.com: CC-BY-3.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/)

The classification layer (grants, obligations, restrictions, disclaimers) added by SALT is licensed under CC-BY-SA-4.0.

See ATTRIBUTION.md for full upstream credits.
